-- I-398: DK-only skin colours were never offered at character create.
-- Wow.exe's skin cycle only offers a colour whose face row for the CURRENT face type
-- exists and passes the class check; a DK always wears a DK face type (flags 5), but stock
-- DK colours only had rows on regular face types. Each DK colour now gets a flags-5 face row
-- for every DK face type the normal colours offer, cycling its existing face textures
-- (same fix F-150 made for orc male). Stock rows are untouched.
-- Generated by: Scripts/Character Skins/dk_skin_faces.py (IDs 25134-25667)

